  "limitations": [
    "Fitted relations require n>=8. The street-food n=6 relation is retained as diagnostic evidence but does not ship; production uses the global direct-evidence prior ratio 0.2757 at grade D ±45%. The premium n=3 relation follows the same minimum-n rule and remains a documented grade-D fallback.",
